    "text": "<p>Consider the cell at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8214;</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>Pt</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>The fraction of total iron present as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> ion at the cell potential of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is ______. (Nearest integer)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Given</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mrow><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>|</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>77</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mrow><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>|</mo><mi>Zn</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn